01:39:44.850 --> 01:39:47.280
obstructive to that sort
of creative approach,

01:39:47.280 --> 01:39:48.240
not facilitative.

01:39:48.240 --> 01:39:50.160
And I think it would be really helpful,

01:39:50.160 --> 01:39:52.230
there might be far too big
for you to answer here,

01:39:52.230 --> 01:39:54.270
but I'd love to know that
somebody's picking up on this

01:39:54.270 --> 01:39:57.090
and looking creatively now,

01:39:57.090 --> 01:39:59.220
not just something we can
do in big, new contracts

01:39:59.220 --> 01:40:00.363
in the distant future.

01:40:02.640 --> 01:40:04.680
- Duncan, quick?
- Yeah, so three points.

01:40:04.680 --> 01:40:07.260
