leaders across the NHS

01:40:39.930 --> 01:40:40.890
in relation to that.

01:40:40.890 --> 01:40:42.420
And then my third point

01:40:42.420 --> 01:40:44.190
I'd be really interested to hear about,

01:40:44.190 --> 01:40:45.870
