in Blackpool, thank
you for the quick step.

01:44:54.331 --> 01:44:55.164
That was very good and

01:44:56.250 --> 01:44:57.840
slightly late in the conversation,

01:44:57.840 --> 01:44:58.673
but thank you very much.

01:44:58.673 --> 01:45:01.080
And I'm, as you all enjoy my joke,

